OL,3,ATrump envoys arrive in Moscow ahead of
OL,4,AUkraine talks, reports say
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo of US President Donald Trump's top
OL,7,Fenvoys have arrived in Moscow, Russian
OL,8,Fmedia has said, ahead of a weekend of
OL,9,Ftalks aimed at accelerating efforts to
OL,10,Fend the war in Ukraine.
OL,12,FSteve Witkoff and Jared Kushner were
OL,13,Fdue in the Russian capital on Saturday,
OL,14,Fwhere they will hold talks before
OL,15,Ftravelling to Kyiv on Sunday for
OL,16,Fdiscussions with Ukraine.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
